  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Prawn Creole is built on the Creole trinity: onion, celery, and green pepper cooked down in butter until soft. The spice comes from cayenne and paprika, not pure heat. Add the prawns only at the end so they stay tender and do not overcook."}]
      },
      {
